<title>UK: General Accident yr operating profit falls.</title>
<headline>General Accident yr operating profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		103.9		  vs 82.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 22.85		  vs 20.3</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 34.25		  vs 31.0</p>
<p> Total premium income   6.2 bln		vs 5.74 bln</p>
<p> Operating pretax	 421		    vs 436</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    720		    vs 559</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast operating pre-tax profits in a range between 372 and 415 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - General Accident Plc.</p>
